;| 0.500000&#160; | primary | 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | true&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 2021-03-0<br />4 17:26:12<br /> 1&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| dm1alx00x | 5432 | up&#160; &#160; &#160;| 0.500000&#160; | standby | 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | false&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| 0&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | 2021-03-0<br />4 17:26:12<br />(2 rows)</p><br /><br /><p>Je ne comprends pas d&#039;ou vient mon problème.</p><br /><p>la log du 2 : </p><p>2021-03-04 17:25:37.514 CET [31357] LOG:&#160; redo starts at 0/16000028<br />2021-03-04 17:25:37.517 CET [31357] LOG:&#160; consistent recovery state reached at 0/16000100<br />2021-03-04 17:25:37.517 CET [31355] LOG:&#160; database system is ready to accept read only connections<br />Host key verification failed.(peut etre la cause....)<br />2021-03-04 17:25:37.592 CET [31370] LOG:&#160; started streaming WAL from primary at 0/17000000 on timeline 1</p>]]></content>
